(text "Universal LV pinout docs/modular/slot_pinout_LV.csv; engine pinout\ncards/engine/engine_slot_pinout.csv. Slot ID straps: slot n = ID n-1, 0 = GND,\n1 = open (card pull-up); IDP makes ID0..2+IDP odd. ID_WP is high (protected);\nPB6 -> AO3400A pulls it low for factory/calibration writes (all LV slots +\nengine). Expanders on I2C2: 0x20 P0 EN_N / P1 PWR_FAULT_N (eFuse FLT#/PGOOD +\nTPS2553 FAULT), 0x21 P0 INT_N / P1 ARM_N, 0x22 P0 CARD_FAULT_N, P10\nENG_PRESENT_N, P11 BANK_EN, P12 BANK_FAULT_N, P13 BANK_OVL_ROOM (out), P14\nBANK_OVL_N (in). Slot ANA_OUT -> 1k -> U109 (EN = PE13 SLOT_ANA_EN, 100k pull-\ndown)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 623.57 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "44740dc1-eb94-4c45-aa5b-536695641e5c"))
(embedded_fonts no))
